<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND BEAT AUSTRALIA IN THIRD ONE-DAY INTERNATIONAL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND BEAT AUSTRALIA IN THIRD ONE-DAY INTERNATIONAL.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>England beat Australia by six wickets in the third and final one-day international at Lord's on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 269 all out in 49.2 overs. England 270-4 in 49 overs.</p>
</text>
